DESCRIPTION:Image Credits: Indrajit Khambe\nJoin photographer Indrajit Khambe for a walkthrough of Grip\, Hold\, Pin\, where he will discuss the making of his acclaimed series Sweat and Soil.\n\nThrough reflections on his long-term engagement with wrestling communities\, Khambe will share insights into his photographic practice\, creative process\, and the stories behind the images\, offering a deeper understanding of the exhibition and the lives it documents. \n\n&nbsp\;
DTEND:20260815T110000Z
