DESCRIPTION:Whether you're coming with your children\, grandparents\, cousins\, neighbours\, or friends who feel like family\, there's something waiting for everyone to discover together at our fifth edition of the Family Day. Wander through the museum\, dive into hands-on workshops\, listen to captivating stories\, solve playful challenges\, and explore exhibitions through activities designed for curious minds of all ages.\n\nFamily Day is an invitation to slow down\, connect\, and experience the museum in ways both familiar and unexpected. All you need to bring is your sense of curiosity\, and the people you love sharing it with!\n\nRegistrations and Schedule details to be out soon !
DTEND:20260830T113000Z
DTSTART:20260830T043000Z
SUMMARY:Family Day - Fifth Edition
